shadowfetch-firewatchd (2.1.4-1) umbra; urgency=medium

  * Replace retired per-workspace llama-server discovery with a bounded,
    loopback-only reader for Buzz's OpenAI-compatible model inventory.
  * Publish no prompt contents or job telemetry; malformed, oversized or
    unavailable Buzz responses degrade to an empty model list.
  * Replace the python3-pynvml recommendation with a bounded nvidia-smi CSV
    probe. The live image no longer pulls Debian's proprietary NVML library,
    while telemetry starts automatically after the user installs a driver.

